Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)Astral！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.81,0:00:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Astral)哼……ZEXAL。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral 你怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这里是……？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.51,0:00:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和Astral一起被吸进去了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说这里是Astral的内心？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)这就是ZEXAL。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.68,0:00:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来已经完全被恶意吞噬了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.61,0:01:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《Astral 我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有很多事必须向你道歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以……所以……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你背叛了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欺骗了我 践踏了我的信任。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(黑暗泽拉)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗之力 将多洛卡德也染上黑暗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑暗多洛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑暗多洛来了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤黑暗·泽拉·武器 奇美拉·十字。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇美拉·十字的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 将场上的魔法·陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.23,0:03:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 通过破坏卡片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将奇美拉·十字 装备给霍普雷V。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了奇美拉·十字的霍普雷V{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然会失去怪兽效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但在战斗中不会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用霍普雷V 攻击闪耀！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你疯了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.39,0:03:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力是闪耀更高！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.30,0:03:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算霍普雷V不会被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.33,0:04:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也要承受伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇美拉·十字的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的怪兽在战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变成２倍可以再攻击一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望之光攻击闪耀！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 手牌过载！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己的怪兽被攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为代价攻击过来的对方怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合可以再攻击一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望之光攻击闪耀！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌过载的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为这张陷阱对象的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.15,0:04:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.55,0:04:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加上100成为攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇美拉·克罗斯的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将怪兽的攻击力变为2倍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再攻击一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用霍普雷V攻击闪光侠！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)哎 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光侠因汉德雷德·欧巴的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该比霍普雷V
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力必定高出100。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算攻击也只会受到伤害啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汉德雷德·欧巴的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加上100成为攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是昏了头啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这么放着不管的话 呵呵呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你真是坏啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}背叛了我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我心中带来愤怒 猜疑{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有悲伤的恶。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.67,0:06:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇美拉·克罗斯的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望射线攻击闪耀！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经无法再相信你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)怎么感觉 这玩意很不妙啊乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)再这样下去把生命值降到500的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到头来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}靠沙尔加索的效果 泽阿尔就败北了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)求你了 快清醒过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你来干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 是想来跟你道歉的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}道歉？ 道什么歉？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确你背叛了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:07:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我失去了相信你的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但作为代价我获得了新的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是邪恶啊… 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从来不知道 邪恶… 憎恨…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然能变成如此强大的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑充能。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望皇攻击闪光！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.15,0:07:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再攻击一次就结束了哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明白… 我明白啊力量正在充满全身。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更多 给我更多憎恨！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.14,0:07:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愤怒！ 猜疑！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当那些填满我的时候我会变得更强！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光… 是我的错。都是我的错……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，我很感谢你哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带给我这份力量的就是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}充满全身的憎恶会赐予我摧毁一切的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}染黑……把一切都染黑！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我的全部！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑充能！！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊，攻过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那将会成为你的临终之时！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！快停下霍普雷V的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）不然的话你这家伙输了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样结束回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 嘛 沙尔加索的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就给我吃下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.03,0:09:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 你的生命值仅仅100。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.53,0:09:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 卡组的卡只剩1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上 你依赖的搭档是那副德行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经 放弃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.15,0:10:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 我绝不放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光也好大家也好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我重要的东西 不会再让你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对 伤害它们！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.81,0:10:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下… 我真正的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法 异热同心之力发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让怪兽超量升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤混沌超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.09,0:10:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是阶级4的假面魔导士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以闪耀叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.104！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诞生于混沌之中当异晶人的力量覆盖光芒之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.66,0:10:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨大的黑暗将起舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}假面魔导士·暗影！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是贝库塔的 CNo.！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.03,0:11:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即使与我的羁绊被切断{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也要独自一人战斗吗……》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以异晶人之力特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.85,0:11:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部吸收。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 每夺取1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.15,0:11:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.82,0:11:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降300点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安布拉特殊召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方场上的魔法·陷阱区域中的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我破坏奇美拉·克洛斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏阶段！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇美拉·克洛斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)装备魔法被破坏掉的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连削减生命值换来的攻击力也白费了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.77,0:11:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安布拉 攻击希望皇V！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量复仇洗牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.89,0:12:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被战斗破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.27,0:12:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把伤害变成0{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.51,0:12:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将被破坏的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}返回额外卡组！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 通过让对手怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次获得攻击的权利{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地把1只怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以攻击表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}白痴吗！ 你这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出怪兽超量的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为萨尔加索的效果伤害…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动墓地里预防胜于治疗的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡除外
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把对手回合中发生的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有效果伤害无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！ 卡组破坏反倒害了自己吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)总算是千钧一发得救了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:12:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)已经不行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 游马在拼命战斗着。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)为了守护星光界一个人努力着！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就用 额外复仇洗牌的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再一次 攻击希望皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.41,0:13:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果有超量单位的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动墓地里的魔法回收者的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过把这卡除外
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组把1张卡送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.31,0:13:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 把墓地最下面的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡放回卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.31,0:13:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那张卡确实
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该没被送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是这样的话 留在卡组里的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这最后一张卡是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 根据效果把卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中的魔法卡返回卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？做这种事有什么意义。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.95,0:13:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！暗影！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将送入墓地的元素英雄的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.47,0:13:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.64,0:14:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过除外元素英雄{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让自己场上的1只元素英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用超量素材的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望！是月之屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.53,0:14:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然总算是撑过去了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.87,0:14:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不过是争取了一点时间罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此，你还是相信那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会获胜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，我相信。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为我想相信那家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以才相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.43,0:14:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不就是相信吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信……？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.02,0:14:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是不死心啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今，发动安布拉尔的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个混沌超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方1张手牌送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要使用2个混沌超量单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！暗黑播种者！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.37,0:15:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后你的手牌有2张被送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？生命值只剩25卡组也只剩1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌和盖牌也都没有，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被逼到这种地步的感想如何啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)贝库塔你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在看哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，对同伴的事就不在意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}关我什么事。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是相信着而已{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信着名为九十九游马的决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给他致命一击吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙最后的一张是 异热同心力场。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.11,0:15:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一张就是最后了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看你这副样子连抽卡都做不到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算与搭档的羁绊被残忍地埋葬了 你还打算继续吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:15:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确我和星光体的羁绊被你给埋葬了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.34,0:16:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.04,0:16:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论用多么卑鄙的手段被送进墓地也好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要还相信着那份积累起来的思念之力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}名为希望的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会来救我的对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！ 说得好像你什么都懂似的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是啊 你最后剩下的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个所谓的希望 就是那张卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你和真月友情的证明。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实 是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.83,0:16:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 现在的我只能抽这张卡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能相信希望去抽了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.43,0:16:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游 游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光… 璃绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.39,0:16:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我已经 无法像至今为止那样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:16:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 无论陷入怎样的困境{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.91,0:17:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信希望去战斗的你我想去相信。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.71,0:17:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)熊熊燃烧吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀着希望的心与心。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.59,0:17:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将两者相连的强烈羁绊会引发奇迹。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我与我自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与我。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.11,0:17:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们两人构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被真正羁绊相连的两人的心重合之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应当传颂的奇迹将会显现！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(泽尔)异热同心变化。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的异热同心？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但事到如今就算进化也太晚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重叠的炽热思念
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.63,0:18:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将世界重构为希望的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.41,0:18:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法·异热同心之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.14,0:18:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！把卡牌改写了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇迹之光驱散黑暗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将限定型异热同心之力的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.46,0:18:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正姿态唤醒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动升阶魔法 异热同心之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己的怪兽异热同心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.05,0:18:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤混沌异热同心。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用阶级４的希望皇 霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.81,0:18:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.85,0:18:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌异热同心·变化！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，CNo.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抓住闪耀于未来的胜利吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重叠的思念，相连的心将改变世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普雷·胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷·胜利？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，凭借萨尔加索的效果你这家伙完蛋了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当努梅隆·力量发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的所有表侧表示卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果都被无效化了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用霍普雷·胜利攻击安布拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个瞬间，霍普雷·胜利的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个超量单元，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.70,0:19:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力加到自己攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:19:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜利充能。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.81,0:20:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}5800。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们的……羁绊之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，霍普雷·胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把暗影、把贝克塔一刀斩断！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 双重胜利斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力/德之助)成功了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.59,0:20:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)成功了，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.13,0:20:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)大逆转呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让人捏了一把汗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.55,0:20:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.57,0:20:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不好。萨尔加索……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:20:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔，撤了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:20:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.02,0:21:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的异晶界带来的光之能量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎打乱了萨尔加索的平衡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.19,0:21:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是想被吸入异次元的夹缝中吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.87,0:21:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这群家伙，别以为这样就赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了，污染了星灵之心的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}邪恶污渍是绝对抹不掉的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被玷污的这份念头会永远残留下来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.83,0:21:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而它会将你们的羁绊逐渐侵蚀殆尽。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.02,0:23:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星灵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.85,0:23:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们赢了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.23,0:23:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.62,0:23:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是我们的战斗才刚刚开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.32,0:23:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.83,0:23:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会变得更强更强。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会做到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.52,0:23:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.78,0:23:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.51,0:23:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.91,0:23:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.55,0:23:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
